{"id":3091,"date":"2025-11-30T22:19:03","date_gmt":"2025-11-30T22:19:03","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=3091"},"modified":"2026-02-14T23:05:28","modified_gmt":"2026-02-14T23:05:28","slug":"cardboard-fruit-packaging-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-fruit-packaging-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Fruit Packaging Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"56\">Cardboard Fruit Packaging Boxes For Produce Transport<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"389\">Fresh fruits need stable, moisture-managed, and clean packaging that helps reduce pressure damage during storage and transport. Many suppliers ship delicate produce in plan carton options alongside <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-vegetable-packaging-boxes\/\"><strong>Cardboard Vegetable Packaging Boxes<\/strong><\/a> so that ventilation, stacking behaviour, and box handling stay consistent across different crop types.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"747\">These cardboard fruit packaging boxes help keep fruits organised, limit bruising, and support freshness while moving through the supply chain. Their firm surfaces support stacking and allow space-efficient storage in cold rooms and stores. They can be used for retail displays and farm sales counters where produce needs to stay grouped and easy to handle.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"804\"><strong data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"804\">Main Advantages Of Sturdy Cardboard Fruit Packaging<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"1088\">\n<li data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"873\">\n<p data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"873\">Helps fruits stay steady during local and long-distance delivery<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"954\">\n<p data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"954\">Supports pressure control for sensitive produce like berries and soft fruits<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1023\">\n<p data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1023\">Lightweight handling that suits daily farm and market operations<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1088\">\n<p data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1088\">Easy for teams to assemble, load, and stack in storage areas<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1144\"><strong data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1144\">Practical Reasons Growers Choose These Fruit Boxes<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1212\">Helps reduce moisture impact when combined with liners or wraps<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1279\">Improves airflow around packed fruits using vents and cut-outs<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1341\">Supports branding with custom printing and colour systems<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1429\">Unit costs can be planned more efficiently for bulk agricultural use across seasons<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"2209\">\n<thead data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1558\">\n<tr data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1558\">\n<th data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1445\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1444\">Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1459\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1458\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1482\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1481\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1506\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1505\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1533\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1532\">Add-Ons And Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1558\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1556\">Usage Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"2209\">\n<tr data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1770\">\n<td data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1598\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dimensions<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1633\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Small to large produce box sizes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1666\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Whiteboard, kraft, corrugated<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1690\">Gloss, matte, spot UV<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1729\">Die-cuts, ventilation holes, handles<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1770\">Fruit farms, retail displays, markets<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1906\">\n<td data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1782\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Printing<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1804\">CMYK or PMS options<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1819\">10pt to 28pt<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1839\">Offset or digital<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1863\">QR codes, brand logos<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1906\">Branding, farm identity, export details<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"2077\">\n<td data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1921\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Board Stock<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1954\">Food-grade and durable options<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1982\">Coated board, kraft paper<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2009\">Soft touch, anti-scratch<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2035\">Smooth internal linings<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2077\">Apples, oranges, grapes, mixed produce<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2209\">\n<td data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2091\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Quantities<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2115\">From 100 to bulk runs<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2130\">Flexible MOQ<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2145\">Bulk pricing<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2163\">Repeat ordering<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2209\">Wholesale fruit transport and distribution<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2 data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2280\">Cardboard Fruit Packaging Boxes With Lids For Freshness Management<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2701\">These boxes with lids help fruits stay covered, clean, and steady during handling. The lid helps protect the top layer from dust and minor movement, while the base supports the weight of lower layers in cold rooms and vehicles. In many produce lines, lidded designs are planned together with ranges like <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/food-related-cardboard-boxes\/\"><strong>Food Related Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a><strong>,<\/strong> so apples, citrus, vegetables, and other fresh items follow similar stacking patterns.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"3000\">Lidded designs are used by farms, stores, and exporters because the outer structure can remain stable during stacking in depots or containers. Graphics, product names, and export labels can be placed on the lid to keep identification clear on pallets, in chill stores, and on front-facing shelves.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3058\"><strong data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3058\">Benefits Of Lidded Fruit Packaging For Fresh Produce<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3322\">\n<li data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3125\">\n<p data-start=\"3061\" data-end=\"3125\">The top layer stays protected from direct pressure during stacking<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3126\" data-end=\"3190\">\n<p data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3190\">Clear areas on the lid for brand printing and origin details<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3253\">\n<p data-start=\"3193\" data-end=\"3253\">Helps fruits remain steady inside export cartons and cases<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3254\" data-end=\"3322\">\n<p data-start=\"3256\" data-end=\"3322\">Better airflow options when side vents and cut-outs are included<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3374\"><strong data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3374\">Operational Reasons To Pick Lidded Fruit Boxes<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3440\">Helps handle mixed fruit varieties within the same outer size<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3507\">Supports long-distance transport with stable stacking patterns<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3577\">Reduces bruising when boxes are moved between storage and display<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3633\">Keeps shelves and pallets arranged and easy to read<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"4394\">\n<thead data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3762\">\n<tr data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3762\">\n<th data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3649\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3637\" data-end=\"3648\">Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3649\" data-end=\"3663\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3651\" data-end=\"3662\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3686\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3685\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3686\" data-end=\"3710\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3688\" data-end=\"3709\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3710\" data-end=\"3737\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3712\" data-end=\"3736\">Add-Ons And Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3762\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3739\" data-end=\"3760\">Usage Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"4394\">\n<tr data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3956\">\n<td data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3809\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Structural Design<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3809\" data-end=\"3837\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Lidded or open-top styles<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3837\" data-end=\"3857\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kraft, corrugated<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"3876\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte, gloss, UV<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3876\" data-end=\"3913\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Locking lid edges and flap systems<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3913\" data-end=\"3956\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Export shipments, regional distribution<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"4102\">\n<td data-start=\"3957\" data-end=\"3971\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Ventilation<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3971\" data-end=\"3996\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Side vents for airflow<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3996\" data-end=\"4017\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrugated E-flute<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4017\" data-end=\"4039\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Protective coatings<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4039\" data-end=\"4070\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reinforced bases and corners<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4070\" data-end=\"4102\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Grapes, berries, soft fruits<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4103\" data-end=\"4248\">\n<td data-start=\"4103\" data-end=\"4120\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Weight Support<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4120\" data-end=\"4144\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Stable sides and base<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4144\" data-end=\"4158\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Heavy board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4178\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Smooth lamination<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4178\" data-end=\"4212\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Extra crease lines for strength<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4212\" data-end=\"4248\">Farm packaging and crate loading<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4249\" data-end=\"4394\">\n<td data-start=\"4249\" data-end=\"4266\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Branding Areas<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4266\" data-end=\"4291\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full printable surface<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4291\" data-end=\"4306\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Coated board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4306\" data-end=\"4324\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Colour printing<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4324\" data-end=\"4354\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Custom labels and ID panels<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4354\" data-end=\"4394\">Market displays and retail pre-packs<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2 data-start=\"4396\" data-end=\"4464\">Bulk Cardboard Fruit Packaging Boxes For Large Scale Distribution<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4466\" data-end=\"4808\">Large fruit suppliers, cold storage units, and farms often use bulk quantities to keep packaging available for peak picking days and scheduled dispatch. In many packaging plans, high-volume projects are grouped with families like <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong>Custom Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a>\u00a0so the same board strengths and folding layouts can be reused across several fruit lines.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4810\" data-end=\"5136\">Bulk options support daily operations by keeping flat-packed cartons available when harvesting teams arrive. These boxes ship flat, reduce space use in warehouses, and can be assembled quickly during busy hours in packhouses or grading lines. Consistent die-cuts and crease lines also make it easier to train seasonal workers.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5138\" data-end=\"5194\"><strong data-start=\"5138\" data-end=\"5194\">How Bulk Fruit Packaging Supports Distribution Speed<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"5195\" data-end=\"5493\">\n<li data-start=\"5195\" data-end=\"5252\">\n<p data-start=\"5197\" data-end=\"5252\">Easy for staff to fold and prepare on packing benches<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5253\" data-end=\"5324\">\n<p data-start=\"5255\" data-end=\"5324\">Reduces storage space requirements inside warehouses and cold rooms<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5325\" data-end=\"5420\">\n<p data-start=\"5327\" data-end=\"5420\">Packaging costs can be planned more efficiently for large agricultural companies and co-ops<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5421\" data-end=\"5493\">\n<p data-start=\"5423\" data-end=\"5493\">Supports steady supply for export programs and regular retail orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5495\" data-end=\"5555\"><strong data-start=\"5495\" data-end=\"5555\">Logistical Benefits Of Bulk Fruit Boxes For Distributors<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li data-start=\"5558\" data-end=\"5625\">Helps reduce loading delays when containers or trucks are waiting<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5628\" data-end=\"5699\">Allows quick packing for multiple fruit sizes using core box families<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5702\" data-end=\"5777\">Improves workflow during peak harvest by keeping folding steps consistent<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5780\" data-end=\"5840\">Supports stable daily supply for retailers and wholesalers<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5842\" data-end=\"6606\">\n<thead data-start=\"5842\" data-end=\"5969\">\n<tr data-start=\"5842\" data-end=\"5969\">\n<th data-start=\"5842\" data-end=\"5856\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5844\" data-end=\"5855\">Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"5856\" data-end=\"5870\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5858\" data-end=\"5869\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"5870\" data-end=\"5893\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5872\" data-end=\"5892\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"5893\" data-end=\"5917\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5895\" data-end=\"5916\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"5917\" data-end=\"5944\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5919\" data-end=\"5943\">Add-Ons And Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"5944\" data-end=\"5969\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5946\" data-end=\"5967\">Usage Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"5996\" data-end=\"6606\">\n<tr data-start=\"5996\" data-end=\"6142\">\n<td data-start=\"5996\" data-end=\"6010\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bulk Supply<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"6010\" data-end=\"6033\" data-col-size=\"sm\">100 to 500,000 units<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6033\" data-end=\"6059\">Kraft, corrugated board<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6059\" data-end=\"6074\">Matte, gloss<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6074\" data-end=\"6103\">Pre-cuts and folding lines<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6103\" data-end=\"6142\">Wholesale fruit shipping and export<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"6143\" data-end=\"6283\">\n<td data-start=\"6143\" data-end=\"6153\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Storage<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6153\" data-end=\"6182\">Ships flat and saves space<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6182\" data-end=\"6199\">Recycled board<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6199\" data-end=\"6215\">Smooth finish<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6215\" data-end=\"6246\">Printed folding instructions<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6246\" data-end=\"6283\">Warehouses and cold storage units<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"6284\" data-end=\"6433\">\n<td data-start=\"6284\" data-end=\"6295\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Handling<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6295\" data-end=\"6327\">Lightweight cartons for staff<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6327\" data-end=\"6343\">Strong fibres<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6343\" data-end=\"6362\">UV coat optional<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6362\" data-end=\"6390\">Grip handles and cut-outs<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6390\" data-end=\"6433\">Daily retail restocking and market runs<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"6434\" data-end=\"6606\">\n<td data-start=\"6434\" data-end=\"6447\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Durability<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6447\" data-end=\"6490\">Supports stacking in storage and transit<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6490\" data-end=\"6508\">Food-safe board<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6508\" data-end=\"6534\">Soft touch where needed<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6534\" data-end=\"6565\">Reinforced bases and corners<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"6565\" data-end=\"6606\">Apples, citrus, melons, mixed cartons<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2 data-start=\"6608\" data-end=\"6670\">Custom Printing Options For Cardboard Fruit Packaging Boxes<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6672\" data-end=\"7113\">Businesses may require printed boxes for retail identification, QR labels, export tracking, and handling notes. Custom printing allows farmers and distributors to show product type, harvest details, grading, and handling guidance clearly on each face of the box. In many fresh produce ranges, print layouts are reviewed alongside Cardboard Vegetable Packaging Boxes so logos, colours, and icons stay aligned across fruit and vegetable lines.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7115\" data-end=\"7415\">Brand printing supports small fruit farms and export programs by making batches easier to identify during loading, rotation, and shelf placement. Inks and coatings can be selected so print remains readable when boxes are stored in chilled conditions or moved through warehouses and retail back rooms.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7417\" data-end=\"7465\"><strong data-start=\"7417\" data-end=\"7465\">What Can Be Printed On Fruit Packaging Boxes<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"7466\" data-end=\"7722\">\n<li data-start=\"7466\" data-end=\"7529\">\n<p data-start=\"7468\" data-end=\"7529\">Packing date or freshness date information for traceability<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7530\" data-end=\"7591\">\n<p data-start=\"7532\" data-end=\"7591\">Batch number areas to support tracking and quality checks<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7592\" data-end=\"7657\">\n<p data-start=\"7594\" data-end=\"7657\">Farm logos, line names, and origin visuals for identification<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7658\" data-end=\"7722\">\n<p data-start=\"7660\" data-end=\"7722\">Fruit grade labels to guide staff and buyers during handling<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong data-start=\"7724\" data-end=\"7778\">How Printed Details Support Fresh Produce Handling<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li data-start=\"7781\" data-end=\"7844\">Supports exporters managing mixed or single-variety shipments<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7847\" data-end=\"7905\">Helps staff identify batches during loading and rotation<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7908\" data-end=\"7977\">Supports shelf and pallet identification in stores and market areas<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7980\" data-end=\"8037\">Helps customers identify products across multiple lines<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Fresh and delicate fruits need packaging that stays steady, protects produce, and supports clean storage for farms and retailers. Our <strong data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"758\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/strong> range helps businesses manage daily fruit handling with strong and lightweight boxes. These cardboard fruit packaging boxes support stacking, reduce bruising, and maintain organized movement from harvest to delivery.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":4537,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"